| `UIImpactFeedbackGenerator` / `UISelectionFeedbackGenerator` / `UINotificationFeedbackGenerator` | `sensoryFeedback(_:trigger:)` | iOS 17+ |
| `MagnificationGesture` | `MagnifyGesture` | iOS 17+ |
